            "title": "The Okra Fiber Shield",
            "startTime": "09:30",
            "endTime": "10:20",
            "duration": 50.0,
            "spokenAnchor": "\u201cOkra is viscous vegetable fiber. When eaten with poundo, it coats the meal, slows gastric transit, and tames the spike.\u201d",
            "visualAnchor": "THE OKRA FIBER SHIELD: How viscous soluble mucilage meters carbohydrate release.",
